LTS","hash":"e23ec2c8","by_type":{"python":64,"binary":15,"deb":155,"rpm":7,"UnknownPackage":1}}},"notes":{"linuxserver":"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-faster-whisper/compare/gpu-v3.9.0-ls11...gpu-v3.9.1-ls12","upstream":"- A custom `--model` advertises all of Whisper's languages again, as it did in\n  3.5.0. Since 3.9.0 it was given the language list of its backend's *default*\n  model, which says nothing about a model the server cannot inspect without\n  downloading it: a custom `onnx-asr` model was advertised as Russian only\n  (GigaAM's list), and custom `sherpa` and `funasr` models were narrowed the\n  same way. Home Assistant then would not offer the model to a pipeline in its\n  own language, for example a Korean onnx-asr model to a Korean pipeline\n  (#148). Default models and `.en` checkpoints still advertise exactly what they\n  support\n\n- The `onnx-asr` and `qwen3-asr` backends no longer keep CPU cores busy after a\n  transcript is sent. onnxruntime's thread pools spin while waiting for more\n  work by default, which slows down whatever starts on the same cores next,\n  such as an LLM answering the command (#135). With onnx-asr's Parakeet on a\n  desktop CPU, each transcript left about half a core-second of spinning in the\n  second after it; that is now zero. onnx-asr transcribes no slower, and\n  qwen3-asr, which runs its decoder once per token, about 2% slower\n  - The `sherpa` backend still spins: sherpa-onnx creates its onnxruntime\n    sessions itself and does not expose the setting\n\n- The `funasr` extra now installs kaldi-native-fbank. FunASR computes\n  SenseVoice's features with torchaudio or, in recent releases,\n  kaldi-native-fbank, but declares neither, so an install with torch and\n  without torchaudio (for example alongside the `transformers` extra) failed\n  every SenseVoice transcription with `ImportError`. torch itself still has to\n  be installed separately. The Home Assistant app and the Docker image were not\n  affected","upstream_url":"https://github.com/OHF-Voice/wyoming-faster-whisper/releases/tag/v3.9.1"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive","TMPDIR=/run/whisper-temp"],"exposed_ports":["10300/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/layers.amd64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-faster-whisper/releases/tag/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/files.amd64.json.gz"},"sbom":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/packages.amd64.json.gz"},"run_json":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-faster-whisper/releases/download/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/run.json","logs_zip":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-faster-whisper/releases/download/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/logs.zip","test_report":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/site/images/faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/","tests":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v3.9.1-ls12/tests.json","report":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/faster-whisper/builds/gpu-v